    "theorem": "SemaevIrreducibilityAudit.actual_S3_absolute_irreducibility_with_control",
    "statement": "theorem actual_S3_absolute_irreducibility_with_control : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (a b : K), (2:K)≠0 → Irreducible (sourceMv a b) ∧ (sourceMv a b).IsSymmetric ∧ (∀ x y z : K, MvPolynomial.eval ![x,y,z] (sourceMv a b)=SemaevS3.S3 a b x y z) ∧ ∀ (L : Type) [Field L] (f : K →+* L), Irreducible (MvPolynomial.map f (sourceMv a b))) ∧ ¬ Irreducible (sourceMv (0:ZMod 2) 0)",
    "decl_sha256": "c4e043d69cf67dc96e73cf41fbbf473ac0de192b56b1e39fb869595dd90f30ce",
    "scope": "Actual literal short-Weierstrass three-variable S3 polynomial only: for every field with2!=0 and arbitrarya,b it is irreducible and IsSymmetric, evaluates exactly to the existing SemaevS3.S3, and remains irreducible after every field homomorphism/scalar extension, including algebraic closure. Actual nested rational-function discriminant/no-root proof, proved coefficient embedding and primitive Gauss bridge, actual MV algebra equivalences and elementary-symmetric identity. Direct F2a=b0nonirreducibility control via a nonunit square; not a refutation of the qualified source or distinct ordinary characteristic2 model. No higher-arity symmetry/absolute irreducibility/arbitrary-split normalization, generic solver complexity or new native-execution theorem.",
